      <h4>Authored Books</h4>
<p class="hanging-indent"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Savoring-Scripture-Six-Step-Guide-Studying/dp/1514004097"><em>Savoring Scripture: A Six-Step Guide to Studying the Bible</em></a>. Downers Grove: IVP Academic, 2022.</p>
<p class="hanging-indent"><em><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Discovering-Isaiah-Interpretation-Reception-Biblical/dp/0802878059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discovering Isaiah: Context, Interpretation, Reception</a></em>. Discovering Biblical Texts Series. Grand Rapids/London: Eerdmans/SPCK, 2021.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Gods-Messiah-Old-Testament-Expectations/dp/0801099757/ref=sr_1_1?dchild=1&amp;keywords=God%E2%80%99s+Messiah+in+the+Old+Testament&amp;qid=1602084908&amp;sr=8-1"><em>God's Messiah in the Old Testament: Expectations of a Coming King</em></a>. Grand Rapids: Baker Academic, 2020. (with Gregory Goswell)</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Eating-Isaiah-Approaching-Structure-Interpretation/dp/900427037X?SubscriptionId=AKIAJGYQBXXGETPQMZBA&amp;tag=speakerfile-20&amp;linkCode=sp1&amp;camp=2025&amp;creative=165953&amp;creativeASIN=900427037X" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>Eating in Isaiah: Approaching the Role of Food and Drink in Isaiah's Structure and Message (Biblical Interpretation)</em></a><em>.<span>&nbsp;</span></em>Biblical Interpretation Series 131. Leiden: Brill, 2014.</p>
<blockquote>
